<title>LEBANON: Lebanese CPI down 0.13 pct in Apr - Banks Assn.</title>
<headline>Lebanese CPI down 0.13 pct in Apr - Banks Assn.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lebanese consumer prices dropped 0.13 percent in April, according to figures issued on Tuesday by the Lebanese Banks Association.</p>
<p>The Association issued the following figures for the Consumer Price Index (Dec 1994 = 100):</p>
<p>    April 97   Mar 97   Feb 97</p>
<p>    126.46     126.62   125.11</p>
<p>Monthly Changes (%)</p>
<p>    (0.13)     1.21     2.48</p>
<p>    - Beirut editorial   (961 1) 602057</p>
</text>
